;; Secrets fallback file — ~/.config/grog/secrets.edn
;;
;; ⚠️ GENERATED AUTOMATICALLY. grog writes this file only when the OS keyring
;; backend is unsupported/unreachable (headless Linux, SSH/WSL, containers);
;; on a normal desktop it uses the OS keyring instead and this file is empty.
;;
;; Format: a map of ACCOUNT-NAME -> secret string (string keys, sorted), e.g.:
;;   {"LLM_API_KEY" "sk-...", "BRAVE_SEARCH_API" "bsa-..."}
;;
;; Normally you never hand-edit this — set secrets with /secret in chat:
;;   /secret set LLM_API_KEY <key>
;; It is created with owner-only permissions and lives OUTSIDE any repo.
{}